WEBVTT

00:08.708 --> 00:16.750
As a white, crescent moon overlooks the town

00:16.750 --> 00:24.748
From within a pale, blue maze
devilish things begin to stir

00:32.265 --> 00:36.069
Boy, here in this sinful world

00:36.069 --> 00:39.072
Believing, dreaming

00:39.072 --> 00:42.909
We are searching

00:42.909 --> 00:48.040
For the place to which souls should aspire

00:49.849 --> 00:58.258
Ah, how much profound darkness
must we turn to light

00:58.258 --> 01:02.829
For the color of the world to change?

01:02.829 --> 01:05.498
Ah, surely someday

01:05.498 --> 01:13.773
Ah, how many profound riddles must we solve

01:13.773 --> 01:18.733
For the door to paradise to open?

01:20.280 --> 01:26.913
Let's begin our journey

01:58.251 --> 02:01.220
So what do you plan to do now?

02:22.542 --> 02:28.276
The 23rd Night
Summer Girl of the Lake

02:29.983 --> 02:31.348
Wow!

02:40.426 --> 02:42.223
C'mon, hurry!

02:47.433 --> 02:50.069
This is a fabulous villa, Kotaro.

02:50.069 --> 02:54.440
Yeah, well. It's close to the hot springs,
plus you can go swimming here in the lake.

02:54.440 --> 02:56.135
It's the ultimate summer resort.

02:56.809 --> 02:59.141
Thank you for inviting us here.

02:59.345 --> 03:01.447
It wouldn't have been any fun if I'd come alone.

03:01.447 --> 03:03.683
It's more fun when everyone's together, right?

03:03.683 --> 03:05.116
Yes, that's right.

03:05.385 --> 03:10.516
But even so, why did they have to come?

03:11.591 --> 03:14.059
Because Loki is here!

03:14.694 --> 03:17.094
We were invited.

03:17.764 --> 03:21.301
Are these three acquaintances
of yours, Kotaro?

03:21.301 --> 03:23.030
No, not at all.

03:23.836 --> 03:27.363
What's the big deal? It's always better
to have lots of girls around.

03:27.440 --> 03:29.567
Is that the problem?

03:30.410 --> 03:32.312
That is the problem.

03:32.312 --> 03:33.836
Right, Master Loki?

03:45.191 --> 03:46.988
Hey, Loki!

03:47.827 --> 03:49.294
Loki!

03:49.596 --> 03:51.063
Hey!

03:58.838 --> 03:59.896
Verdandi!

04:01.307 --> 04:02.274
Here!

04:03.610 --> 04:05.912
Come on in for a swim, Loki!

04:05.912 --> 04:08.881
Let's swim together, Loki!

04:09.148 --> 04:10.274
I'm fine here.

04:10.516 --> 04:12.848
Huh? Why?

04:13.219 --> 04:16.279
Oh, I get it! You can't swim!

04:16.823 --> 04:18.291
It's not like that...

04:18.291 --> 04:20.827
You're like a dumbbell in water?

04:20.827 --> 04:22.522
That's not it!

04:22.829 --> 04:25.923
Hey, Reiya. I hear Loki can't swim!

04:46.586 --> 04:49.384
What are you gawking at? We lost again!

04:50.256 --> 04:51.223
Ow...

04:52.458 --> 04:54.517
Your serve is excellent, big sister.

04:59.732 --> 05:00.566
Huh?

05:00.566 --> 05:01.901
What's the matter?

05:01.901 --> 05:03.892
Uh, it's nothing.

05:04.604 --> 05:06.205
Sorry to keep you waiting!

05:06.205 --> 05:09.663
I made you some juice using
locally grown tropical fruits!

05:10.043 --> 05:12.603
Ah! I was so thirsty!

05:13.346 --> 05:15.109
Thanks, Yamino.

05:15.315 --> 05:18.341
Hey! You got it all wrong, Loki!

05:21.020 --> 05:22.088
Everyone knows that ramune and grilled corn on
the cob are what you eat at summer getaways!

05:22.088 --> 05:25.692
Ramune
&
Grilled Corn
Everyone knows that ramune and grilled corn on
the cob are what you eat at summer getaways!

05:26.259 --> 05:29.962
Narugami? You even have a job out here?

05:29.962 --> 05:32.198
Rule #1 of any part-timer worth his salt:

05:32.198 --> 05:34.689
People having fun is your
chance to make money.

05:35.435 --> 05:37.232
Who'd like a ramune?

05:42.408 --> 05:44.177
What's that?

05:44.177 --> 05:47.146
Could it be Nessie?!

05:47.146 --> 05:48.773
A strange mystery!

05:57.056 --> 06:02.756
Ho, ho! I am the master of this beautiful
lake, the mysterious thief, Frey!

06:05.331 --> 06:08.459
My Japanese beauty, which of
these did you drop?

06:08.801 --> 06:12.705
The golden one? The silver one?
The steel one?

06:12.705 --> 06:14.002
Well, which is it?

06:19.545 --> 06:22.482
Hey, Narugami! Let me have one
of those corn on the cobs!

06:22.482 --> 06:23.716
Me too!

06:23.716 --> 06:25.684
I'd like one that's a little burned.

06:38.731 --> 06:41.199
Why did you save me?

06:42.235 --> 06:44.704
A time will come that will mark
the end of the gods,

06:44.704 --> 06:47.440
and all in this world shall cease to be.

06:47.440 --> 06:50.739
All of existence will be as a fleeting dream.

06:51.978 --> 06:54.105
There is no meaning in dreams.

06:54.947 --> 06:58.075
Well, whatever. But don't expect a thank you.

07:10.863 --> 07:12.626
Get in quietly, will you?!

07:12.799 --> 07:15.427
A real man needs to do things with gusto!

07:20.440 --> 07:26.003
Aah. As I thought, this outdoor spa
is connected to the lake!

07:26.312 --> 07:28.610
Would you call that "gusto"?

07:31.250 --> 07:34.651
Wow, you've got such smooth skin!

07:35.721 --> 07:39.091
You really do. It's so soft!

07:39.091 --> 07:41.661
Let me feel it too!

07:41.661 --> 07:47.934
I'm jealous! Your skin is so smooth
and supple, like a baby's!

07:47.934 --> 07:50.269
It feels so good!

07:50.269 --> 07:52.430
It's so smooshy!

07:53.406 --> 07:55.772
Oh, I wish we had one too!

07:56.943 --> 07:58.411
Huh? What?

07:58.411 --> 08:01.608
What's so soft? What's so smooshy?

08:08.654 --> 08:10.923
A sailing we will go...

08:10.923 --> 08:13.192
Having a dog in the bath is
simply unacceptable.

08:13.192 --> 08:14.760
What was that?!

08:14.760 --> 08:16.625
I ain't no damn dog! I'm a wolf!

08:18.965 --> 08:21.433
That dog sure likes to bark.

08:22.935 --> 08:24.766
It's peaceful, isn't it?

08:26.372 --> 08:27.740
Now that I think about it,

08:27.740 --> 08:31.870
this is the first time our whole family
has gone to a hot spring together.

08:32.311 --> 08:35.246
Yeah, you're right. But...

08:35.848 --> 08:37.110
But, what?

08:37.583 --> 08:39.881
This isn't our whole family.

08:40.853 --> 08:42.655
That's right...

08:42.655 --> 08:43.952
Daddy...

08:44.690 --> 08:47.659
Still. It's nice, isn't it?

08:48.761 --> 08:49.887
Yes!

09:18.257 --> 09:20.560
I did just take a bath, you know.

09:20.560 --> 09:22.228
Let's take a little break.

09:22.228 --> 09:24.696
You're the one who said you'd come along.

09:24.897 --> 09:28.594
Yeah, but I didn't think it was so far!

09:31.704 --> 09:33.539
Mountain lilies!

09:33.539 --> 09:35.166
They're so pretty!

09:37.376 --> 09:39.173
I'm going on ahead.

10:23.756 --> 10:24.950
Hello.

10:25.257 --> 10:26.554
Hello.

10:27.026 --> 10:28.926
Are you staying at one of the resorts too?

10:29.962 --> 10:30.929
Yes.

10:32.298 --> 10:35.968
Well, we're having a barbecue
at my place this evening.

10:35.968 --> 10:37.435
You can come too, if you'd like.

10:53.653 --> 10:55.280
Kotaro!

10:55.454 --> 10:56.921
Were you waiting for me?

10:58.491 --> 10:59.617
Uh, yeah...

11:00.092 --> 11:03.084
Those lilies were so pretty
that I had to pick...

11:08.501 --> 11:10.128
It's dead.

11:41.200 --> 11:44.136
This is my special smoked barbecue.

11:44.136 --> 11:47.940
The smoke chips I'm using are imported
directly from North America,

11:47.940 --> 11:51.899
and are a blend of hickory and
apple wood chips.

11:52.178 --> 11:53.338
It smells wonderful.

11:53.579 --> 11:54.603
Doesn't it?

11:55.481 --> 11:57.116
This meat is delicious!

11:57.116 --> 11:58.951
It's tender and has such a rich flavor.

11:58.951 --> 12:01.554
The more you chew it, the more
the flavor comes out.

12:01.554 --> 12:02.755
Doesn't it, though?

12:02.755 --> 12:06.714
It's a specialty beef that was only
available through online order.

12:06.992 --> 12:09.995
Hey, gimme something to eat!
Anything! I can't reach!

12:09.995 --> 12:13.055
What, do I only get to smell it, is that it?!

12:15.034 --> 12:15.668
Here.

12:15.668 --> 12:16.068
Thanks.
Here.

12:16.068 --> 12:16.693
Thanks.

12:17.303 --> 12:18.327
Hey!

12:20.773 --> 12:22.808
Here you go, Fenwir.

12:22.808 --> 12:26.972
Ecchan. You sure are a sweetheart.

12:28.180 --> 12:30.916
I tell ya, the green peppers are
the star of any barbecue!

12:30.916 --> 12:35.054
Their savory scent and texture
are more than I can take!

12:35.054 --> 12:36.851
Right, Gullinbursti?

12:40.426 --> 12:42.587
Hey, Four-Eyes! Gimme another helping!

12:44.163 --> 12:46.665
There should be some in that rice cooker.

12:46.665 --> 12:48.064
It's empty!

12:49.135 --> 12:51.569
It can't be! I cooked almost two liters.

12:51.771 --> 12:54.507
It's common knowledge that you make
twice as much rice as meat!

12:54.507 --> 12:56.634
A couple of liters will go
in the blink of an eye!

12:58.010 --> 13:00.638
I've never heard of such common knowledge.

13:00.980 --> 13:03.608
Here you go, Loki. They're all cooked.

13:03.849 --> 13:04.975
Thanks.

13:05.084 --> 13:07.419
Here you go, Lord Loki.
They're all cooked!

13:07.419 --> 13:09.148
Please eat up, okay?

13:10.089 --> 13:13.616
Oh, I know! I'll feed them to you myself!

13:15.327 --> 13:16.988
Here! Say "ahh."

13:19.265 --> 13:22.434
Hey, you! What do you think
you're doing with my Loki?!

13:22.434 --> 13:24.800
"My Loki"?

13:26.872 --> 13:31.172
A little girl like you has no place
trying to make a move on Loki!

13:31.911 --> 13:34.379
A girl all in white?

13:34.847 --> 13:38.647
Yeah. And she disappeared
all of a sudden, "poof!"

13:42.688 --> 13:45.657
I've got it! I'll bet that girl was a ghost!

13:46.425 --> 13:48.227
It's a strange mystery!

13:48.227 --> 13:49.428
A ghost?

13:49.428 --> 13:53.899
Hey, Kotaro! This area has
ghost stories like that, right?

13:53.899 --> 13:58.237
Like, a young, pretty girl dies but her
rage lives on in the form of a ghost!

13:58.237 --> 14:01.866
It's not like they'd build a resort
in a place like that!

14:02.107 --> 14:04.405
Jeez, you're no fun.

14:05.344 --> 14:08.214
But, she really did disappear, you know.

14:08.214 --> 14:12.241
She was wearing glasses and
had long, wavy hair.

14:13.919 --> 14:17.156
Hey, everyone, I put some more on the grill!

14:17.156 --> 14:18.521
Okay!

14:28.100 --> 14:29.897
I'm stuffed.

14:30.402 --> 14:34.429
I can't take another bite.
I ate about a week's worth of food.

14:35.674 --> 14:40.373
Would anyone care for some after-dinner tea?
There's ice cream too.

14:40.846 --> 14:42.748
What? Ice cream?!

14:42.748 --> 14:44.950
I thought you couldn't eat any more.

14:44.950 --> 14:47.418
Dessert's another story!

14:48.821 --> 14:51.590
I'm so stuffed I couldn't even
drink a glass of water.

14:51.590 --> 14:54.718
In that case, you should go
walk off the meal.

14:55.661 --> 14:57.185
A walk, huh?

14:58.197 --> 15:00.757
Yamino, save some ice cream for me, okay?

15:01.000 --> 15:02.334
Ah, all right.

15:02.334 --> 15:04.063
Now where's a flashlight...

15:06.639 --> 15:10.200
The air is so clear and the
stars are so pretty.

15:11.610 --> 15:15.381
Lord Odin grabbed hold of the spark
that flew from Muspelheim,

15:15.381 --> 15:19.385
the region of fire, and placed it in the sky.

15:19.385 --> 15:23.515
The sun and the moon were also made
by the hand of Lord Odin.

15:29.261 --> 15:30.558
Odin...

15:32.598 --> 15:34.725
Miss Ghost!

15:35.367 --> 15:37.870
Miss Ghost!

15:37.870 --> 15:40.168
Are you here?

15:40.572 --> 15:42.802
Miss Ghost!

15:45.044 --> 15:47.046
Where could she be?

15:47.046 --> 15:49.879
Maybe she only appears during the day.

15:55.321 --> 15:57.118
It's gorgeous!

16:06.365 --> 16:08.833
If there are no ghosts then
I'll search for UFOs!

16:09.168 --> 16:12.501
Ventra, Ventra! Hey there, UFOs!

16:23.048 --> 16:25.175
Miss Ghost?

16:36.628 --> 16:38.027
Wait!

17:15.300 --> 17:16.733
Wait!

17:23.909 --> 17:25.035
No way.

18:02.047 --> 18:03.275
Mayura!

18:03.449 --> 18:04.916
Loki!

18:07.052 --> 18:08.349
Are you okay, Mayura?

18:09.221 --> 18:11.553
Yeah. Thanks, Loki!

18:12.291 --> 18:13.588
Thank goodness.

18:20.632 --> 18:21.599
Watch out!

18:23.135 --> 18:24.261
Run, Mayura!

18:25.037 --> 18:26.129
Loki.

18:42.955 --> 18:44.623
Go back and join the others!

18:44.623 --> 18:45.958
Loki! I'm coming too!

18:45.958 --> 18:47.084
Forget it!

18:49.294 --> 18:50.591
Loki...

19:22.861 --> 19:25.694
Where are you? Why don't you
stop hiding and come out?

19:31.570 --> 19:32.969
No choice, huh?

19:51.089 --> 19:52.579
Veil Lubadrock!

19:54.593 --> 19:55.719
Cuerios!

20:09.541 --> 20:11.008
Heimdall...

20:15.180 --> 20:16.477
Loki.

20:21.954 --> 20:23.021
Master Loki!

20:23.021 --> 20:23.885
Daddy!

20:24.156 --> 20:26.158
We were worried about you!

20:26.158 --> 20:27.284
Guys...

20:27.426 --> 20:29.661
Thank goodness you're okay!

20:29.661 --> 20:30.929
You're okay!

20:30.929 --> 20:33.090
Yeah. Where's Mayura?

20:34.566 --> 20:36.602
Good grief! You disappeared so suddenly,

20:36.602 --> 20:40.470
I started worrying what we'd do if you were
eaten by a bear or something out in the woods!

20:41.673 --> 20:43.300
There aren't any bears here!

20:45.244 --> 20:47.246
Ah, you're back!

20:47.246 --> 20:48.770
Let's do some fireworks! Fireworks time!

20:49.047 --> 20:50.716
Ooh, nice!

20:50.716 --> 20:52.240
Yeah!

21:12.704 --> 21:14.171
Mayura...

22:16.802 --> 22:28.771
A moonlit road pierces the dense fog

22:30.482 --> 22:42.227
Perplexedly, we all wander towards tomorrow

22:42.227 --> 22:49.334
We escape the darkness of a desolate town

22:49.334 --> 22:55.774
Which threatens to halt even the telling of myths

22:55.774 --> 23:05.283
Transcending the limitless skies,
we're on a journey

23:05.283 --> 23:09.621
Even if we're hurt

23:09.621 --> 23:21.633
We're sure we can still make it,
so we want to keep on praying

23:21.633 --> 23:23.362
Believe in Heaven

23:31.176 --> 23:32.477
Next Episode

23:32.477 --> 23:35.714
Next Episode
The key words for the next episode are
"family," "library" and "tea party."

23:35.714 --> 23:39.050
Next Episode
Hey, Verdandi, you're an inventor, right?
That's so cool!

23:39.050 --> 23:40.252
Next Episode
Oh, I wouldn't go that far.

23:40.252 --> 23:42.254
Next Episode
When do the ideas for new
inventions come to you?

23:42.254 --> 23:43.722
Next Episode
Hmm, good question.

23:43.722 --> 23:46.057
Next Episode
Sometimes I'll get inspirations
while I'm taking a bath.

23:46.057 --> 23:47.092
Next Episode
You know, when I'm relaxed.

23:47.092 --> 23:48.393
Next Episode
In the bath, huh?

23:48.393 --> 23:50.462
Next Episode
Hey, now that I think about it, I do too!

23:50.462 --> 23:51.797
Next Episode
Oh? You think of inventions?

23:51.797 --> 23:55.033
Next Episode
No! I have a latte when
I get out of the bath!

23:55.033 --> 23:55.600
Next Episode
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:55.600 --> 23:56.268
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:56.268 --> 23:56.535
The 24th Night
The Shadow of Solitude
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:56.535 --> 23:57.769
The 24th Night
The Shadow of Solitude
"The Shadow of Solitude"

23:57.769 --> 23:59.337
The 24th Night
The Shadow of Solitude
Another strange mystery!

23:59.337 --> 24:01.032
The 24th Night
The Shadow of Solitude
